                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<div>This online supplement presents a timeline of major events unfolding in the RPAS (drones) industry between 2000 and 2018. It captures events occurring in four phases: \"Recognizing Future Potential (2000-2004)\", \"Regulatory Bricolage (2005-2010)\", \"Focused Efforts (2011-2015)\", and \"Working Towards Harmonization (2016-2018)\". </div><div><br></div><div>It should be read in conjunction with K.M. Smolka & P.P.M.A.R. Heugens (2020) \"The Emergence of Proto‐Institutions in the New Normal Business Landscape: Dialectic Institutional Work and the Dutch Drone Industry\", Journal of Management Studies, 57(3), 626-663, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/joms.12540.\" target=\"_blank\">https://https://doi.org/10.1111/joms.12540.</a></div><div><br></div>"
                }
              }
            ]
